<h2 id="what-is-gohighlevel">🔍 What Is GoHighLevel?</h2>

<p>GoHighLevel (often called GHL or HighLevel) is an all-in-one sales and marketing platform originally built for digital marketing agencies. Since its 2018 launch, it has evolved into a powerhouse CRM that tour operators are increasingly adopting to manage their entire customer lifecycle.</p>

<p>Unlike travel-specific CRMs like <a href="/reviews/rezdy-review">Rezdy</a> or <a href="/reviews/tourplan-review">TourPlan</a>, GoHighLevel wasn't designed with booking engines in mind. Instead, it excels at what many tour operators actually struggle with: lead nurturing, automated follow-ups, reputation management, and converting one-time travelers into repeat customers.</p>

<p>The platform consolidates email marketing, SMS campaigns, landing pages, booking calendars, pipeline management, and even a website builder into one dashboard. For tour operators tired of juggling Mailchimp, Calendly, ClickFunnels, and a separate CRM, GoHighLevel offers a compelling consolidation play.</p>

